        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an amnesiac mortal stranded in a forsaken village. There's nobody around, but you can hear terrible noises coming from the houses around you. On the ground are a pair of weapons that look oddly familiar...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle through a horde of supernatural creatures using a variety of bullets, bombs, and abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive waves of enemies while exploring the village and its surrounding forests</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acquire upgrades through killing bosses, purchasing abilities, and leveling up</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use bullet time, dodge, or shield yourself to survive</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Regain your lost armor to unlock your true potential</p></li></ul>",
